<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt">Good Morning,<o:p><=
/o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></=
span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt">Please can you assi=
st on the matter related to your attached Engineers Report.<o:p></o:p></spa=
n></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></=
span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt">Third Party are ask=
ing total number hours required to
<b><u>PAINT</u></b> the vehicle. &nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></=
span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt">Could you kindly as=
sist - o</span>ut of the 18 hours quoted in your report, how many hours are=
 allocated to the paint?
<span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></=
span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt">We look forward to =
hearing from you.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></=
span></p>
